OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for Headscarf
OL,4,ARevolutionary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque will be installed at the
OL,7,Fformer home of one of Hull's famous
OL,8,FHeadscarf Revolutionaries.
OL,10,FYvonne Blenkinsop, who lived on
OL,11,FSunningdale Road in Hessle, took on the
OL,12,Fmight of the UK fishing industry and
OL,13,Fgovernment alongside three other women,
OL,14,Ffighting for safety improvements
OL,15,Ffollowing the 1968 Triple Trawler
OL,16,FTragedy that claimed 58 lives.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
