OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for Headscarf
OL,4,ARevolutionary
OL,5,
OL,6,FHessle Town Council said it was
OL,7,Fapproached by the group Headscarf Pride
OL,8,Fwith the idea of installing a blue
OL,9,Fplaque. Officials said the plaque would
OL,10,Fbe formally approved at a council
OL,11,Fmeeting.
OL,13,FCouncillor David Nolan said: "This is
OL,14,Fhonouring, from the point of view of
OL,15,FHessle, one of ours who did a lot of
OL,16,Fwork towards trawler safety."
